      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">L4 输出特征</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">  形状: [B, ~176, H/2, W/2]</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-family:Consolas">  组成: 96 + 64 + 16</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">本级特点</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 接近全分辨率, 关注像素级细节</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 不使用 FFC (浅层依赖局部性)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  · 三路门控 + sa4 仍然作用</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">去向</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  → Level 5 (H) 输出头 ↑×2</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: 4dcea15dd80c04d268b463b04c0b25db0bd4a1b54a71fde825f71c0afcd63420
